{
  "description": "Photosynthesis-style process-rate engine — the learner adjusts light, CO₂, and temperature sliders and watches the process rate and its limiting factor recompute live, with input-node radii/colors on a biology-canvas reflecting each factor's saturation. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
